{
  "key": 19896,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_CaptainIFeelSeasick",
      "en_US": [
        "Captain: Ooargh…\n",
        "I feel hideous…\f",
        "Urrp! Seasick…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_RubbedCaptainsBack",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} rubbed the Captain’s\n",
        "back!\r",
        "Rub-rub…\n",
        "Rub-rub…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ThankYouHaveHMForCut",
      "en_US": [
        "Captain: Whew! Thank you!\n",
        "I’m feeling much better now.\r",
        "You want to see my hidden Cut\n",
        "technique?\r",
        "I could show you my prized Cut\n",
        "technique if I weren’t so ill…\r",
        "I know! You can have this!\n",
        "This Hidden Machine!\r",
        "Teach Cut to your Pokémon, and\n",
        "you can see it Cut anytime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ObtainedHM01FromCaptain",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} obtained HM01\n",
        "from the Captain!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_Text_GymHack_AndTakeThisToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, and take this, too!\r",
        "It does the same job outside of\n",
        "battle, no Pokémon needed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ExplainCut",
      "en_US": [
        "Using Cut, you can chop down\n",
        "small trees.\r",
        "Why not try it with the trees\n",
        "around Vermilion City?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_HowToConquerSeasickness",
      "en_US": [
        "How to Conquer Seasickness…\n",
        "The Captain’s reading this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_YuckShouldntHaveLooked",
      "en_US": [
        "Yuck!\n",
        "Shouldn’t have looked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_SSAnneWillSetSailSoon",
      "en_US": [
        "Captain: …Whew!\r",
        "Now that I’m not sick anymore,\n",
        "I guess it’s time.\r",
        "The S.S. Anne will set sail soon!\r",
        "Farewell, until our return to\n",
        "Vermilion City!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0909_CV_CANVAS_SSANNE_CAPTAIN_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
